    "body": "The angled-surface mantle repair is installed. The old code released the wall before TASK_CLIMB was accepted, then teleported to the cached roof target 1.2 seconds later—the exact fall-then-roof-snap you reported. This build keeps the verified lip until Rockstar reports the climb/vault task accepted, never performs that delayed coordinate snap, and returns to attached climbing on rejection. Test a flat lip and roughly 45-degree roof; rejection may remain attached, but it must not release/fall and later teleport.",
